<title>GERMANY: BASF says Q1 pre-tax at 1.16 bln dmk.</title>
<headline>BASF says Q1 pre-tax at 1.16 bln dmk.</headline>
<text>
<p>LUDWIGSHAFEN, Germany, May 15, Reuter - Three months to March 31. (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     1,163   vs 1,120</p>
<p>    Group sales				  13,439  vs 11,832</p>
<p>    Sales in Germany			   3,521   vs 3,182</p>
<p>    Sales outside of Germany		 9,918   vs 8,650</p>
<p>    Group capital expenditures	     635     vs 606</p>
<p>    Group personnel expenses		 2,587   vs 2,448</p>
<p>    Group workforce (as of March 31)     102,578 vs 106,420</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   714     vs 692</p>
<p>    Income from operations		   1,160   vs 1,066</p>
<p>    Financial results			  3	 vs 54</p>
<p>    Fixed assets				 23,179  vs 20,967</p>
<p>    Inventories and receivables	    18,833  vs 16,993</p>
<p>    Cash and cash items			5,232   vs 6,760</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
